;; The providers Xi bundles: the xi-providers repo at a pinned commit.
;; `bb providers:fetch` checks it out into providers/ (bb providers:link links
;; your own checkout there instead), `bb package` copies the :bundled packages
;; into the npm package, `bb providers:pin` moves :sha to the checkout's
;; pushed HEAD. :bundled is the package directories under packages/, in the
;; order the model picker lists them (xi.providers.config).
{:repo    "https://github.com/floscr/xi-providers.git"
 :sha     "b3c9c6caa387136df09910a53556fafed766c7ec"
 :bundled ["anthropic" "ollama" "codex" "opencode"]}
